.Dd October 19, 2026
.Dt BUILD-SIMH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm build-simh
.Nd build the SIMH simulators prebsd needs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar simulator ...
.Nm
.Fl Fl list
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
builds the simulators of
.Pa simh.json
(pdp11, vax780, pdp10-ka and pdp10-ki) from source trees pinned by commit, and installs them in
.Pa simh/bin/ ,
where
.Xr prebsd 1
looks first.
Each source tree is kept as a bare repository holding just that commit, so a build does not need the upstream again.
Builds happen in
.Pa build/ ,
and a simulator in
.Pa simh/bin/
is replaced only after the new one has built.
.Pp
The tape code of the simulators is patched so that a tape file rewritten by the host while the
simulator has it attached is not served stale
.Pq Pa simh/patch-sim-tape.py .
.Pp
The PDP-10 KI10 simulator comes from Richard Cornwell's tree: the restore script of his system
tape runs out of step on other builds.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr prebsd 1
